summary:
  The first heartbeat tick after a wake takes down a cast along with the order.

history:
  The receivers pull the stream themselves and may have played through the
  whole sleep; the tick stopped the television in the other room.

target:
  package/contents/ui/main.qml

find:
              else if (!root._casting) _orderLapsed();

replace:
              else if (true) _orderLapsed();

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_invariants.py::test_the_deadline_counts_from_when_the_order_was_last_heard.
  Line-neutral.
